{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "The Shopping Spree"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Fashionista"}, {"type": "position", "content": 6}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 7}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.3"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Identify and describe taste and style in fashion through a wider range of language in both work and social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn8le07ob06re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Making Comparisons"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "We use <span class=\"italic\">as</span> + adjective/adverb + <span class=\"italic\">as</span> to make comparisons when the things we are comparing are equal in some way:<br/><br/><span class=\"italic\">This leather jacket is <span class=\"strong\">as soft as</span> a sweater!</span><br/><br/>We use <span class=\"italic\">not as ... as</span> to make comparisons between things which aren't equal:<br/><br/>This leather jacket is<span class=\"strong\">n't as expensive as</span> that one.</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I don't seem to be <span class=\"strong\">as energetic as</span> I used to be!"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I think that working is  <span class=\"strong\">not anywhere near as easy as</span> going to school."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I don't think shopping for work wear is <span class=\"strong\">as easy as</span> shopping for school clothes."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Being responsible and dependable for work is not <span class=\"strong\">as interesting as</span> it sounded when we were at school. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Sounds like we're <span class=\"strong\">not getting as much down time as</span> we need to regulate our lives."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Responses with <span class=\"italic\">So</span> and <span class=\"italic\">Neither</span>"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "We us <span class=\"italic\">so</span> and <span class=\"italic\">neither</span> for positive and negative agreement."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">So</span> is used to show agreement with positive statements. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Sometimes we also use <span class=\"italic\">too</span> to express the same thing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example:<br/><br/><span class=\"strong\">Amanda</span>: <span class=\"italic\">I like this dress!</span></span><br/><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: <span class=\"italic\">So do I. / I do too.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Neither</span> is used to show agreement with negative statements. <br/>Sometimes we also use <span class=\"italic\">either</span> to express the same thing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example:<br/><br/><span class=\"strong\">Amanda</span>:<br/><span class=\"italic\"> I don't think this fits well.</span><br/><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>:<br/><span class=\"italic\">Neither do I. </span>(neither is a negative word)<br/><span class=\"italic\">I don't either. </span>(either is used with the negative)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you use <span class=\"italic\">so</span> and <span class=\"italic\">neither</span>, the auxiliary needs to agree with the verb tense in the original statement."}, {"type": "text", "content": "A more colloquial form of positive agreement is <span class=\"italic\">Me too</span>.<br/>A more colloquial form of negative agreement is <span class=\"italic\">Me neither</span>."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Statement</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Positive agreement</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I think that working is not anywhere near as easy as going to school.<br/><br/>Here I thought studying was tougher! <br/><br/>I get irritable and short-tempered sometimes!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"So do I.<br/><br/>So did I. <br/><br/>So do I! \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Statement</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Negative agreement</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I don't seem to be as energetic as I used to be!<br/><br/>I never thought shopping would tire me out! <br/><br/>I don't think shopping for work wear is as easy as shopping for school clothes.<br/><br/>I don't mean to be.<br/><br/>I don't come across as being anywhere near as affable as Peter does. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Neither do I!<br/><br/>Neither did I!<br/><br/>I don't either. <br/><br/>Me neither! <br/><br/> No. Neither do I.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tough"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "difficult"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  Here I thought studying was tougher! "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le07ob06aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about people's personalities."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to tire out"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to make tired "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Shopping never used to tire me out! "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le07ob06aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "responsible"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "able to be trusted to get the job done"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Being responsible isn't always fun!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le07ob06aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "dependable"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "able to be depended on "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She has always been a dependable employee. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le07ob06aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "aggressive"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "seeming angry and hostile"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I know that some days I seem aggressive at work."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le07ob06aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "affable"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "likable"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Peter is such an affable person. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le07ob06aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to not have a care in the world"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to not have anything to worry about"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He always acts as if he hasn't got a care in the world!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le07ob06aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "down time"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "free time to relax"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Sounds like we're not getting as much down time as we need."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le07ob06aud08"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Identify two famous people in your country."}, {"type": "text", "co