01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn8le07ob06re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn8le07ob06re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm glad we stopped for coffee and a snack!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I don't seem to be as energetic as I used to be!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Neither do I! Why is that?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I think that working is not anywhere near as easy as going to school.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: So do I. Here I thought studying was tougher! <br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: So did I. I never thought shopping would tire me out! <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Neither did I! Well, to our defence we are relentless when it comes to finding the perfect dresses, sweaters, scarves and jewelry."}, {"time": "26500", "image": "engenn8le07ob06re2img05.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Not to mention pants, blouses and jackets and belts! <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I don't think shopping for work wear is as easy as shopping for school clothes.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I don't either. Being responsible and dependable for work is not as interesting as it sounded when we were at school. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I know that some days I seem aggressive and impatient at work. I don't mean to be.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Me neither! I get irritable and short-tempered sometimes!"}, {"time": "52000", "image": "engenn8le07ob06re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: So do I! Sounds like we're not getting as much down time as we need to regulate our lives.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I don't come across as being anywhere near as affable as Peter does. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: No. Neither do I. I wonder how he stays so positive and relaxed. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: He always acts as if he hasn't got a care in the world!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Hmm ... We'll have to ask him."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}]}